        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"JimB\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jimb/48/2093_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> JimB:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Ah, thank you. I thought it was some expansion or variant set or something I do not yet own.<br></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Well, it <em>has</em> <a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/1104083/tosxs-sotm-the-cauldron-expansion-tracking\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">an expansion you don't own</a> along with lots of other variants (<a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/forum/1051076/sentinels-of-the-multiverse/variants\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">link to variants forum</a>).  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=12\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
