        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/d6d6ee/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-20T07:18:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just had a game yesterday and it was Baron Blade VS Tempest, Bunker and Fanatic. Baron Blade almost killed Tempest (there were 2 backlash fields) and whittled bunker to single digit. On the final turn Tempest had Electrical Storm and Grievious Hailstorm deal 7 damage (with Gene-Bound Shackles), Bunker managed to use omnicannon and flak cannon to deal 11 damage (3 cards + turret mode) and Fanatic used Sacrosanct Martyr to deal 5 damage but Baron Blade managed to hold onto his final healthpoint! Only to be taken out by... police backup.&nbsp;</p>",
